  "delta": [
    "phoneDSH P25 additive durable event type: agent.comm. The envelope shape is unchanged.",
    "agent.comm is written with local origin comm-service; team-tools is not a registered local source.",
    "CCR-1: principal.botId/sessionId, causationId and correlationId are absent in iOS bytes and explicit null in the upstream golden; both decode identically and both validate.",
    "CCR-1: event-envelope.schema.json is durable-only; ephemeral events use event-envelope.ephemeral.schema.json, carry no commitSeq and are never stored.",
    "CCR-2: authz.grant_snapshot is a durable type whose data is frozen by authz-grant-snapshot.schema.json; the vector is produced by the Swift BotGrantSnapshot encoder."
